design php files only in pages folder mentioned in the URLs in pages.txt file

In pages.txt file, the number mentioned with each city would be the priority number of each page

Keep in mind priority number is that which is most used number of the page outside of contact numbers section

for pages with priority number 03008977885 , contact numbers for that will be 03456826761 and 03003006220

for pages with priority number 03332874135  , contact numbers for that will be 03003006220 and 03456826761 

In dog image section, pick image accordingly page priority number of a file and pick from /images/0300 and /images/0333

if priority number starts with 0300, then rename image in /images/0300 folder and if priority number starts with 0333, then rename image in /images/0333 folder

write image src as https://armydogcenterpk.com/images/services/kpk/{city}.jpeg

replace {city} with page name such as badin.jpeg for badin.php page



sample file for designing php pages is jati.php
Use powershell script to immediately make copies of this sample file accordingly our requirements

At last, also rename the images in /images folder accordingly using powershell script, if images are renamed incorrectly then correct them